m_search:queryparam}&${stale_hours:queryparam}&${stop_minutes:queryparam}&${alarm_burst:queryparam}&${raw_limit:queryparam}&from=${__from}&to=${__to})\n\n[← Apex 3 Floor 1 — 2D](/factory-twin-3d/?view=2d) · [← Apex 3 Floor 1 — 3D](/factory-twin-3d/?view=3d) · **Source:** `public.machine_event` · **Policy:** latest known state; no 15-minute expiry"
